OL,3,GNEWSAResident of Churchill's estate
OL,4,Amakes emotional return
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last living pre-World War II
OL,7,Fresident of the family home of Sir
OL,8,FWinston Churchill is to make an
OL,9,Femotional return to help launch a new
OL,10,Fdisplay celebrating the work of her
OL,11,Ffather at the estate.
OL,13,FThe father of Gwen Hibbert, nee Hill,
OL,14,Fwas Albert Hill, who worked as the
OL,15,FChurchills' head gardener at Chartwell,
OL,16,Fin Kent, from 1927 until 1944.
OL,18,FOn Thursday, 97-year-old Hibbert will
OL,19,Funveil a new display telling the story
OL,20,Fof her father in her birthplace and
OL,21,Fchildhood home, Garden Cottage.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
