OL,3,GNEWSAResident of Churchill's estate
OL,4,Amakes emotional return
OL,5,
OL,6,FChartwell curator, Katherine Carter,
OL,7,Fsaid that having Hibbert at the estate
OL,8,Fwill be "truly special".
